{"scene_id": "s00111", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s00111.fountain", "heading": "INT. GRAIN SILO FREIGHT ELEVATOR - NIGHT", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "VALERIAN ASHFORD-OKORO", "names": ["VALERIAN ASHFORD-OKORO", "VALERIAN"], "gender": "m", "first": 4, "spoke": 17}, {"id": 1, "name": "DOROTHEA KLEIN-AMADI", "names": ["DOROTHEA KLEIN-AMADI", "DOROTHEA"], "gender": "f", "first": 5, "spoke": 14}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. GRAIN SILO FREIGHT ELEVATOR - NIGHT", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "A rusted cage elevator, open at the sides, hangs in the cavernous dark of a silo.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "A single caged bulb swings overhead.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Below, forty meters down, a drift of grain glimmers like gold sand.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "VALERIAN ASHFORD-OKORO, a lean man in his fifties with a gray ponytail and an unbuttoned coat, grips the control lever.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "Across from him stands DOROTHEA KLEIN-AMADI, a woman in her forties in a flight jacket, her back pressed to the cage and her eyes on his hands.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "The elevator hums, mid-shaft, motionless.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "She breathes slowly.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "He does not look at her.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Press the button.", "name": "VALERIAN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Which one?", "name": "DOROTHEA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "The red one.", "name": "VALERIAN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "She doesn't move.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "He sighs.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It won't hurt you.", "name": "VALERIAN", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's the alarm.", "name": "DOROTHEA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's the stop.", "name": "VALERIAN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It says ALARM.", "name": "DOROTHEA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "The label is wrong.", "name": "VALERIAN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "She laughs, shrill and brittle.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "He turns his head.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "In the swinging light, his eyes are red-rimmed and exhausted.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Press it.", "name": "VALERIAN", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Why do you need it stopped?", "name": "DOROTHEA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "So we can talk.", "name": "VALERIAN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "We are talking.", "name": "DOROTHEA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "So we can talk without the sound.", "name": "VALERIAN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "She studies him.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "Then slowly, she lifts a gloved hand and presses the red button.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "A shriek tears through the silo.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "He winces.", "para": 5, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "She holds it.", "para": 5, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "The cage shudders and jerks, and her face is a mask of calm.", "para": 5, "sent": 5, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "He lunges.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "She drops the glove and slams him against the wall.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "For a second they are locked together, breathing in each other's faces, and then she shoves him back, hard, and the lever snaps under her palm.", "para": 6, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "The elevator drops, ten feet, twenty, and catches with a bang that rattles every bone.", "para": 6, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "They hang there, gasping.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "The alarm dies.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "The bulb swings.", "para": 7, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "In the new silence, a faint trickle of grain begins to run.", "para": 7, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's the stop.", "name": "DOROTHEA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": ["panting"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's the stop.", "name": "VALERIAN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["gasping"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "He slides down the wall to sit.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "She stays upright, trembling.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Now talk.", "name": "DOROTHEA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You won't like it.", "name": "VALERIAN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I have never liked you.", "name": "DOROTHEA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "He laughs.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "It becomes a cough.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "She waits.", "para": 9, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I sold the shipment.", "name": "VALERIAN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Which shipment?", "name": "DOROTHEA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "All of it.", "name": "VALERIAN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "She stops breathing.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "Looks at the dark below.", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "The grain has found a seam and is pouring, a thin gold thread into the black.", "para": 10, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 57, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Who bought it?", "name": "DOROTHEA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 58, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You don't want to know.", "name": "VALERIAN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 59, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Valerian.", "name": "DOROTHEA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 60, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Your brother.", "name": "VALERIAN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "The bulb stops swinging.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "The elevator creaks.", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "She closes her eyes.", "para": 11, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "When she opens them, her face is clear and cold and very quiet.", "para": 11, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 65, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Good.", "name": "DOROTHEA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 66, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Good?", "name": "VALERIAN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 67, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I was hoping it was him.", "name": "DOROTHEA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 68, "kind": "action", "text": "She steps over his legs, grabs the broken lever, and wrenches it back into the housing.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 69, "kind": "action", "text": "The motor groans.", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 70, "kind": "action", "text": "The elevator begins, slowly, to rise.", "para": 12, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 71, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Where are we going?", "name": "VALERIAN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 72, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "To see my brother.", "name": "DOROTHEA", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 73, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "And me?", "name": "VALERIAN", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 74, "kind": "action", "text": "She looks down at him.", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 75, "kind": "action", "text": "Ignores the question.", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 76, "kind": "action", "text": "Rolls her shoulders.", "para": 13, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 77, "kind": "action", "text": "The cage climbs toward the dim circle of the roof, grain still whispering through the dark below.", "para": 13, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}]}